OL,3,GNEWSAClassic TT qualifying cancelled
OL,4,Adue to wet roads
OL,5,
OL,6,FMonday evening's qualifying sessions
OL,7,Ffor the Classic TT and Manx Grand Prix
OL,8,Fhas been cancelled due to rainfall
OL,9,Fmaking the roads unsafe.
OL,11,FOrganisers said a large section on the
OL,12,Fcourse was affected, with more showers
OL,13,Fdue and the conditions were not
OL,14,Fexpected to have improved in time for
OL,15,Fthe session.
OL,17,FThe cancellation means road around the
OL,18,F37.7 mile (61km) Mountain Course will
OL,19,Fnot close as planned at 18:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
