OL,3,GNEWSAClassic TT qualifying cancelled
OL,4,Adue to wet roads
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe evening's schedule had been due to
OL,7,Finclude qualifying laps for the Senior,
OL,8,FSupersport, Junior, and Sportbike Manx
OL,9,FGrand Prix competitors, as well as
OL,10,Fthose taking part in the Classic TT.
